{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497510/extras/0e559f383ad11df3bd63d0ade3283df9.avif?t=1770718315\" width=630 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When crime strikes the countryside, only a famous city detective can solve the case. He'll soon discover there's more to this case than meets the eye! Set for a journey, meet different characters, find clues and finally unravel a riveting mystery in this fun and colorful hidden object puzzle adventure game!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it by yourself or with your kids, this game makes a perfect choice for every hidden object fan or family fun! Enjoy bright and lighthearted levels and locations, with no time limit or pressure of any kind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497510/extras/04de97d31c58b222866a4414a01be755.avif?t=1770718315\" width=630 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Hidden Object &amp; Puzzle Adventure \u2013 investigate\u00a0 scenes and solve mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Relaxed, family-friendly hidden-object gameplay \u2014 no timers, no pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Hint &amp; Journal \u2013 always know where to go next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 Beautifully illustrated scenes $ playful soundtrack \u2013 immerse yourself in the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Choose your difficulty level \u2013 from relaxed exploration to true challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf4 Play completely offline \u2014 anytime, anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd12 No data collection \u2014 your privacy is safe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79 Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click / Tap to search scenes, collect clues, combine items from your inventory, and complete mini-games to progress the story. Use hints if you get stuck \u2014 but the reward is uncovering more of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Play your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, investigate and solve the mystery in your own way: adjustable challenge. Win Achievements &amp; Collectibles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c Atmospheric adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gripping mystery: narrative-driven gameplay with a strong detective lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive locations: explore, seeks, search and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497510/extras/3274eb571861d77721724a6e03b0407e.avif?t=1770718315\" width=630 height=170 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 60 UNIQUE levels with hundreds of hidden objects and zoom scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > HOURS of finding objects and solving puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > INVESTIGATE the countryside and solve the case</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > FIND items that will help your investigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > SOLVE mini-games and puzzles along the way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > PLAY memory, find difference, solve jigsaw puzzles and other games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > SEARCH for clues and write the investigation diary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > BEAUTIFUL bright and colorful graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > WIN achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > NO TIME LIMITS or penalties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > SUITABLE for young audience as well</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Show Me!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2497510/b0509fa2a8aa5b1b7beb7199ea1b0df60293cadf.jpg"},{"name":"No Shame in Askin'","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2497510/3d8d1679d53fa93c2c0b1d2a73bd438dd2ef5c29.jpg"},{"name":"Observant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2497510/00d2d26663eabac4cc3c7769bc1d8672c14c9d09.jpg"},{"name":"Hawk-Eyed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2497510/a888e91200d5db5bce67c15855dc1868c52b7c25.jpg"},{"name":"X-ray vision","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2497510/245cb022141b455e63f17f8e251e11a542b81ef0.jpg"},{"name":"Do you remember?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2497510/9359a2ebd678f074f0f6a752969b6ed85bceb5d8.jpg"},{"name":"On the Tiles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2497510/2806069bdd11d381842b88898fabfb539973e13c.jpg"},{"name":"What's the difference?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2497510/df714c612b93ec585e9a8dcce642e482bbe2f79f.jpg"},{"name":"Sorting out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2497510/ac430907dd05ba3fba28a72476b8dad125e91abd.jpg"},{"name":"Spin me around","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2497510/9373ba86d585953d973526267e004309709ace83.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2497510?t=1770718315","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com